      "title": "QUIC: STREAM frame out-of-order and retransmission handling",
      "message": "QUIC: STREAM frame out-of-order and retransmission handling\n\nSupport reordering and retransmission detection of STREAM frames.\nAdd a preference to turn out of order handling off (retransmission\ndetection will still work in that case, up to the point of the\nfirst out of order frame.)\n\nThis doesn't support the \"split MSP\" facility that the TCP dissector\nhas (yet?)\n\nFix #20947\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n",
